#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:5 7e69115969384ffc92c6bb23e60b94ff
msgid "Balance Bot Control Modes"
msgstr "平衡机器人控制模式"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:6 5b387a126b934d41bb63eee67d03991b
msgid ""
"Some Rover Control Mode work slightly different in Balance Bots. This "
"section explains some of the important differences to be kept in mind while "
"using these modes. For more information on any mode, check the :ref:`Control"
" Modes<rover-control-modes>` page for Rover."
msgstr ""
"部分 Rover 控制模式在平衡机器人上的表现略有不同。本节说明在使用这些模式时需注意的一些重要差异。有关任何模式的更多信息，请参阅 Rover 的 "
":ref:`控制模式<rover-control-modes>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:9 89321609a1eb4e26ba44481a6d6590c3
msgid "Hold/Manual"
msgstr "Hold/Manual"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:10 96b714cf2c4746fab86db8bb82a1d36e
msgid ""
"Hold and Manual Mode in Balance Bots use a Pitch Control System to control "
"and maintain pitch angle. In Hold Mode, the input pitch to the control "
"system is set to 0 degrees, to keep the Vehicle upright(equivalent to zero "
"throttle input). In Manual Mode the input throttle from the user is mapped "
"to a pitch angle and sent to the Control System. The control system in turn "
"calculates the required throttle and sends it to the motors. As explained in"
" the :ref:`working <balance_bot-working>` section, this causes the vehicle "
"to accelerate in the direction of pitch. The steering input from the user is"
" handled the same way as in Rover."
msgstr ""
"平衡机器人中的 Hold 和 Manual 模式使用俯仰控制系统来控制和维持俯仰角。在 Hold 模式下，输入到控制系统的俯仰角设置为 0 "
"度，以保持车辆直立（相当于零油门输入）。在 Manual 模式下，用户的油门输入被映射为俯仰角并发送到控制系统。控制系统再计算所需油门并发送给电机。如 "
":ref:`工作原理 <balance_bot-working>` 部分所述，这会导致车辆在俯仰方向上加速。用户的转向输入与 Rover "
"中的处理方式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:15 4fe2b738af3d47ee9a541a482eade8b5
msgid ""
"In Manual Mode, continuous acceleration in one direction can saturate the "
"motors, as they reach maximum speed. The vehicle will not be able to balance"
" as further acceleration is not possible. This is the disadvantage of "
"running Balance Bots in Manual Mode."
msgstr ""
"在 Manual 模式下，向一个方向持续加速可能导致电机达到最高转速而饱和。此时车辆将无法继续加速，也无法保持平衡。这是在 Manual "
"模式下运行平衡机器人的缺点。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:17 e5f1661724264a2e827f1b6832cf580e
msgid ""
"In Manual and Hold modes, we can only control the pitch angle of the "
"vehicle, not the velocity. It is possible to be at zero pitch angle(upright "
"position) and have a non zero velocity. To stop the vehicle from drifting in"
" Manual mode, it must be made to pitch in the reverse direction. If these "
"modes are entered with a non zero initial speed(from Acro or Auto modes), "
"the vehicle can accelerate and crash."
msgstr ""
"在 Manual 和 Hold 模式下，只能控制车辆的俯仰角，而不能控制速度。车辆可能在俯仰角为零（直立位置）的情况下仍具有非零速度。要在 Manual"
" 模式下阻止车辆漂移，必须使其向反方向俯仰。如果以非零初速度（来自 Acro 或 Auto 模式）进入这些模式，车辆可能会加速并坠毁。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:20 e996de88fc7a4b3cba20a83e557e6a83
msgid "Acro"
msgstr "Acro"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:21 dd44c6f5016e45628f2ff1b1d24e7c6a
msgid "This is the recommended drive mode for Balance Bots."
msgstr "这是平衡机器人的推荐驾驶模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:23 3eac676605ae4c7e87720aab47ca8a38
msgid ""
"Acro Mode lets you control the speed by internally controlling the pitch "
"angle. Separately, it also allows you to control the turn rate."
msgstr "Acro 模式通过内部控制俯仰角来控制速度，同时也允许控制转向速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:27 5a4897b3b9b74d55b636f7c79657e994
msgid ""
"Acro mode uses a speed and turn rate control system. In Rover the output "
"from the Acro control system goes straight to the motors. In Balance Bots, "
"the output from the Speed Controller is mapped to a desired pitch and sent "
"to the Pitch Controller used in Manual/Hold Mode."
msgstr ""
"Acro 模式使用速度和转向速率控制系统。在普通 Rover 中，Acro "
"控制系统的输出直接发送到电机。在平衡机器人中，速度控制器的输出被映射为期望俯仰角，并发送到 Manual/Hold 模式中使用的俯仰控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:31 9725839b98d0424b9f6d729330d34e1b
msgid "Guided/Auto/RTL"
msgstr "Guided/Auto/RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-modes.rst:32 36962007291347aaa0b69d72a883abf9
msgid ""
"All of these modes are implemented as they are in Rover. No Balance Bot "
"specific differences exist. Instructions on configuring and using these "
"modes can be found in the :ref:`Rover Control Modes page<rover-control-"
"modes>`."
msgstr ""
"这些模式的实现方式与普通 Rover 完全相同，不存在平衡机器人特有的差异。配置和使用这些模式的说明可在 :ref:`Rover "
"控制模式页面<rover-control-modes>` 中找到。"
